      "hints": [
        "Look for the spring relationship in which force is proportional to extension.",
        "A straight force–extension line through the origin identifies the named spring law."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "The force–extension graph is a straight line through the origin, so force is proportional to extension.",
        "This is the relationship F = kx for a spring within its proportional limit.",
        "The law is Hooke's law."
      ],
