        "At 4.0 cm extension, the graph gives a spring force of 5.60 N upwards.",
        "The cylinder is in equilibrium, so spring force plus upthrust equals its 6.20 N weight.",
        "upthrust = 6.20 − 5.60 = 0.60 N."
      ],
      "checking": {
